Subject: [PATCH] feat: load the font files addons ship on first use

FontString:SetFont with a font file an addon ships
(Interface\AddOns\<Addon>\...) used the default font, as only Blizzard's
font paths were known. Load such a file from the AddOns directories on
first use, resolved ignoring case, with the weight, style and stretch of
its face, so a bold file of a family renders bold. A path below
Interface\AddOns that names no file raises the client's error,
"FontString:SetFont(): Invalid font asset (<path>): file not found", and
leaves the font as it was.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
